    "# 🕌 Islamic Inheritance Distribution System\n",
    "## Master's Dissertation — Altayeb Mohammed Adam Yahya\n",
    "### Ulyanovsk State Technical University — 2026\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "**Dissertation Title:**  \n",
    "*Development and Research of an Approach to Inheritance Distribution in Sudan Jurisprudence Based on Machine Learning*\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## System Architecture (Hybrid Option 3)\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "Free Text Input (English)\n",
    "         ↓\n",
    "  [NER Extraction Layer]        ← Extracts heirs from text\n",
    "         ↓\n",
    "  [Sharia Rule Engine]          ← Deterministic calculation (100% accurate)\n",
    "         ↓\n",
    "  [ML Validation Layer]         ← Ridge Regression verifies result\n",
    "         ↓\n",
    "  [Explanation Generator]       ← Produces human-readable explanation\n",
    "         ↓\n",
    "  Structured Output (JSON + Text)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Key principle:** ML assists and validates — the Rule Engine decides.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## What this notebook does:\n",
    "1. Generates 21,590 Sharia-compliant inheritance cases\n",
    "2. Trains and compares 10 ML regression models (as in dissertation)\n",
    "3. Selects best model (Ridge Regression, R²=0.99995)\n",
    "4. Builds the complete hybrid pipeline\n",
    "5. Tests on real inheritance questions\n",
    "6. Auto-retraining mechanism (Chapter 2.8)\n",
    "7. Performance dashboard (Chapter 2.6)"
   ]
